ion." (at 15.24 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid ae19df26-17f8-47f9-aeba-682c0c4ca440))(text "Audio: 64 clocks per stereo frame. Separate microphone input and amplifier output I2S buses. BTL speaker terminals must never be grounded." (at 15.24 27.939999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid 4a03eb49-b525-49a4-ae93-ff970ce24a0c)))